{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13208290","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13208290","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320829001:1":{"text":"喂！小伙子！你手里的雕刻刀，是在酒馆捡到的吗？","source_cn":"喂！小伙子！你手里的雕刻刀，是在酒馆捡到的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF777FD199B2793C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::0":{"text":"刻刀","source_cn":"刻刀","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF463B239694679B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320829002:0":{"text":"雕刻刀？这不是剥皮刀吗？虽然造型奇怪了点。","source_cn":"雕刻刀？这不是剥皮刀吗？虽然造型奇怪了点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x201A305B1621DEBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320829003:1":{"text":"你仔细看那把刀的刀头，凸起的刀刃形状各个不一样！","source_cn":"你仔细看那把刀的刀头，凸起的刀刃形状各个不一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBEFC4363D209A35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320829004:1":{"text":"是为了在不同角度进行精细的雕琢，如果你拿去剥皮，刀刃会损毁，皮毛也会划伤！","source_cn":"是为了在不同角度进行精细的雕琢，如果你拿去剥皮，刀刃会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5594D496C7B6945B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320